@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = paste-access-token-here

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-admin-password"
}

### 学生列表（需要管理员令牌）
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
